{"about_the_game":"<strong>Battle Planet - Judgement Day</strong> is a planetary rogue-lite top-down shooter. You are one of the universe's 3 most wanted criminals on the run, fighting your way through hordes of aliens, military and police units. There is only one way to reclaim your freedom - destroy them all...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099170/extras/1e0bc5e9275fdeddc690ff3c77a05216.poster.avif?t=1730223520\" width=600 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099170/extras/1e0bc5e9275fdeddc690ff3c77a05216.webm?t=1730223520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099170/extras/1e0bc5e9275fdeddc690ff3c77a05216.mp4?t=1730223520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Escape a crashed prisoner transport ship and fight the authorities in a non-stop mayhem of blazing gunfire and planet destroying bombs sent to perforate you and the ground beneath your feet.<br><br>Doomed to be killed in a never ending loop, your trial of survival relies solely on your hardcore skills<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099170/extras/4b2531fca4eb9aa356d76e7f2e268da3.avif?t=1730223520\" width=616 height=84 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>couch co-op mode: die together in excessive sessions with friends<br></li><li>permanently upgrade your convict and the weapon arsenal after each run<br></li><li>battle your way through hordes of enemies designed to torment you<br></li><li>power up your ass with a load-out of perks<br></li><li>face bosses that have your controller buttons on their death list</li></ul><br>Make them pay, to make sure today is NOT your judgement day.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099170/extras/1bf9bd50055a51eae668860c23c30f8b.avif?t=1730223520\" width=616 height=107 /></span><br>Battle Planet - Judgement Day is now supporting the Tilt Five Glasses, Game Board and Wand Controller. <br><br>With the Tilt Five Augmented Reality glasses, you can experience the game in a whole new immersive space. Watch physical and virtual worlds blend together and make your next planetary killing spree one to remember!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099170/extras/c09ca06a10cf2b4abe0c316c29e404d6.avif?t=1730223520\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br>Garry Shyman, composer of Bioshock, Middle Earth: Shadow of Mordor and Destroy All Humans worked on our soundtrack bringing to life the intensity of the battlefield with a fast paced electronic orchestral mix<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1099170/extras/4a690d7069def8138b66bef9355988d3.avif?t=1730223520\" width=616 height=108 /></span><br>Inspired by the times where games were hard to beat and as big rogue-like fans ourselves, our inspirations for Battle Planet - Judgement Day were a constant reminder of the quality and feeling we wanted to achieve:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dead Cells<br></li><li>Spelunky<br></li><li>The Binding of Isaac<br></li><li>Nuclear Throne<br></li><li>Rogue Legacy<br></li><li>Alienation<br></li><li>Super Stardust</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"adbbcb3ab6d245808741cfb6c9e570a780e472a2.jpg","localized_name":"Survivalist","name":"Survivalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/adbbcb3ab6d245808741cfb6c9e570a780e472a2.jpg"},{"icon":"fc064951394de6083e5f56dc4bb8c384504988cc.jpg","localized_name":"Annihilator","name":"Annihilator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/fc064951394de6083e5f56dc4bb8c384504988cc.jpg"},{"icon":"2a37f8b49f751071bcd6488f3ee0985594ff5d93.jpg","localized_name":"Battle Master","name":"Battle Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/2a37f8b49f751071bcd6488f3ee0985594ff5d93.jpg"},{"icon":"0980ff99e61b54883cbc007507b33a3fbefb7432.jpg","localized_name":"Double Trouble","name":"Double Trouble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/0980ff99e61b54883cbc007507b33a3fbefb7432.jpg"},{"icon":"7c875a79277d6b08d58593f9c393aef9d50226d7.jpg","localized_name":"Technician","name":"Technician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/7c875a79277d6b08d58593f9c393aef9d50226d7.jpg"},{"icon":"143358be9440cc34f8a8166148b3dc2cd01f7932.jpg","localized_name":"Maniac","name":"Maniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/143358be9440cc34f8a8166148b3dc2cd01f7932.jpg"},{"icon":"ccb2368a411a332c1f99a9c8137805276192e860.jpg","localized_name":"Warmachinist","name":"Warmachinist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/ccb2368a411a332c1f99a9c8137805276192e860.jpg"},{"icon":"a3fdc8668774ca8c13b872f7314470755997d401.jpg","localized_name":"Weapon Specialist","name":"Weapon Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/a3fdc8668774ca8c13b872f7314470755997d401.jpg"},{"icon":"5b3097349a35bf069a300e6aedfbf991d62323af.jpg","localized_name":"Craftsman","name":"Craftsman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/5b3097349a35bf069a300e6aedfbf991d62323af.jpg"},{"icon":"82ff792de9a507b67ef57a77ea200e70be3ceed5.jpg","localized_name":"Perfectionist","name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1099170/82ff792de9a507b67ef57a